Before you try to build the examples in this directory, make sure
that your environment is properly set up, i.e. that you have run
one of the scripts (nslenv.sh or nslenv.csh) that set up NSLHOME, 
PATH, LibraryPath variables for your installation.

If you have not run them, do so now. They are in 
<installation_directory>/scripts

To build the examples, do
	make

This will create three executables that calculate a sum:
adder - interface <-> application communication through function calls
adderAv - interface <-> application communication with active values
adderInt - internationalized version - works only on POSIX systems

To remove the examples built, do
	make clean
